      "id": "cadences-full-half-plagal-and-deceptive",
      "title": "Cadences: Full, Half, Plagal, and Deceptive",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** harmony | **Difficulty:** 5/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Cadences are harmonic punctuation at phrase endings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "types",
      "title": "Types",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Authentic (PAC/IAC)**: V→I — full stop. **Half**: ends on V — comma, question. **Plagal**: IV→I — 'amen' cadence. **Deceptive**: V→vi — surprise."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "in-dance-tunes",
      "title": "In dance tunes",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A part often half-cadences at midpoint; B part authentic-cadences home. AABB structure maps to these patterns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "accompaniment",
      "title": "Accompaniment",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Don't push dominant too early — steals the half cadence's lift."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "entities": [],
  "entity_order": [],
  "playlist": [],
  "tunes": [],
  "key_points": [],
  "reading_list": [],
